When DrPanda MCP tools are available (`mcp__<server>__systems_status`), read
`.dsh/skills/dr-panda-mcp/SKILL.md` (also linked at
`skills/dr-panda-mcp/SKILL.md`) and follow it before investigating.

Start with `systems_status`; never invent an environment, target, or selector;
stay read-only; report truncation. If the DrPanda MCP tools are not available,
stop and ask the user to configure the DrPanda MCP server. The runtime `scope`
and `capabilities` always override this rule and the skill.
